    "detailed_description": "<h1>GET THE FULL GAME!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's much more to explore in The Last Flame! This prologue version is just a taste of what the full game has in store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get access to a lot more stuff! Make amazing builds with 325 items, 65 heroes, 150 relics and 60 origins. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to the third act and meet the final boss in a secret act! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 30 challenging enemies and 12 bosses! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through 5 difficulties which will challenge your knowledge and strategy! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your builds to their limit in the endless mode, a mode where you try to reach the highest floor! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in diverse and fun new ways with the challenge modes! </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/56ae07413c1b9249cb56e307fb5671c1.avif?t=1736444515\" /></span>The Last Flame is a roguelike auto-battler which focuses on build creation, strategy and decision making. Recruit special heroes, fight deadly encounters, loot and craft powerful gear, discover and create unique synergetic builds! Every run, you will need to create powerful builds that will take down your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/39393e00635d89de3fc964412a6759dc.poster.avif?t=1736444515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/39393e00635d89de3fc964412a6759dc.webm?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/39393e00635d89de3fc964412a6759dc.mp4?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/7bfa7548d53d2b0f5ff3c9295448c544.avif?t=1736444515\" /></span>The Last Flame offers an incredible amount of build diversity. Combine heroes, items, relics and origins together to create amazing builds! Hero and team building have been designed with flexibility and freedom at their core which allows you to discover and create unique synergetic builds every single run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/361d8bc4a116ba41e7d7c9fdb1c5e167.poster.avif?t=1736444515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/361d8bc4a116ba41e7d7c9fdb1c5e167.webm?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/361d8bc4a116ba41e7d7c9fdb1c5e167.mp4?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/776fc62cd83d61d52c9a6b07360f3244.avif?t=1736444515\" /></span>In between the automated combats, you will have to cleverly guide your heroes through the adventure by making the smart decisions! Manage your resources, choose the optimal path in the map, make powerful builds, and strategically position and plan the combat phase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/eeebef49846e3a72cdab7dd4663d9e19.poster.avif?t=1736444515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/eeebef49846e3a72cdab7dd4663d9e19.webm?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/eeebef49846e3a72cdab7dd4663d9e19.mp4?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/96c2e90869c78fb4d4d4204a4d8a43be.avif?t=1736444515\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get access to a lot more stuff! Make amazing builds with 325 items, 65 heroes, 150 relics and 60 origins. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue the adventure in the third act, and meet the final boss in a special act!<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 30 challenging enemies and 12 bosses! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through 5 difficulties which will challenge your knowledge and strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your builds to their limit in the endless mode, a mode where you try to reach the highest floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in diverse and fun new ways with the challenge modes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/67a99c7d72edc3cb8c4907041d1a5638.poster.avif?t=1736444515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/67a99c7d72edc3cb8c4907041d1a5638.webm?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/67a99c7d72edc3cb8c4907041d1a5638.mp4?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>",
