l boss in a special act!<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 30 challenging enemies and 12 bosses! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through 5 difficulties which will challenge your knowledge and strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your builds to their limit in the endless mode, a mode where you try to reach the highest floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in diverse and fun new ways with the challenge modes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/67a99c7d72edc3cb8c4907041d1a5638.poster.avif?t=1736444515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/67a99c7d72edc3cb8c4907041d1a5638.webm?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517810/extras/67a99c7d72edc3cb8c4907041d1a5638.mp4?t=1736444515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>",
